      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "여기서 처음 게임 시작했어요. 저 PC방이요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "This is where I started gaming. That PC bang right there.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3c249939-0f6d-5394-8d0b-7febe36db202",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "간판은 낡았지만 불은 켜져 있다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The sign is worn out, but the lights are still on.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
