      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네. 감독님 덕분이에요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Yeah. All thanks to you, Coach.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "78684ad1-2ed2-55a0-be2a-7df2a54c7044",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "진짜요? 사장님 놀라시겠다!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "For real? The owner's going to freak out!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
